{"4887280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Marrowood", "steam_appid": 4887280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887280/extras/3c59855d7b5ad410b7c2ef55d004044d.poster.avif?t=1786279968\" width=400 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887280/extras/3c59855d7b5ad410b7c2ef55d004044d.webm?t=1786279968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887280/extras/3c59855d7b5ad410b7c2ef55d004044d.mp4?t=1786279968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marrowood is a haunting tycoon game where you and your estranged siblings go back home and rebuild the family farm. Experienced solo or with up to 4 siblings (you don't actually have to be related; we won't check!). Work together to build up the farm, optimize it for peak efficiency, feed the town, and learn the secrets you chose to forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887280/extras/b17cbea0504f8702d90a1a406e753303.poster.avif?t=1786279968\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887280/extras/b17cbea0504f8702d90a1a406e753303.webm?t=1786279968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887280/extras/b17cbea0504f8702d90a1a406e753303.mp4?t=1786279968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring the farm back to it's glory days. Process livestock, sell meat to the towns folk, and upgrade your facilities to do it even better next time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887280/extras/90f4092b11db24cd59cac42d8e4a44ab.poster.avif?t=1786279968\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887280/extras/90f4092b11db24cd59cac42d8e4a44ab.webm?t=1786279968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887280/extras/90f4092b11db24cd59cac42d8e4a44ab.mp4?t=1786279968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuilding the farm might sound easy, but be careful the towns folk hunger. Survive monsters, each with their own unique challenge, as they attack, haunt, and destroy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887280/extras/bed0acdb2bafe4309d6fe6fe52f562b3.poster.avif?t=1786279968\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887280/extras/bed0acdb2bafe4309d6fe6fe52f562b3.webm?t=1786279968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887280/extras/bed0acdb2bafe4309d6fe6fe52f562b3.mp4?t=1786279968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marrowood is the product of a newly engaged couple who formed Our Home Studio as a way to bring their (sometimes f--ked up) ideas to life. With deep experience in interactive media, design, and marketing Nicole and Luke use every skill in their tool belt to push creativity further. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887280/extras/ccf2fcd3d0db405507640b70ebf73618.poster.avif?t=1786279968\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887280/extras/ccf2fcd3d0db405507640b70ebf73618.webm?t=1786279968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887280/extras/ccf2fcd3d0db405507640b70ebf73618.mp4?t=1786279968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887280/extras/3c59855d7b5ad410b7c2ef55d004044d.poster.avif?t=1786279968\" width=400 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887280/extras/3c59855d7b5ad410b7c2ef55d004044d.webm?t=1786279968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887280/extras/3c59855d7b5ad410b7c2ef55d004044d.mp4?t=1786279968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marrowood is a haunting tycoon game where you and your estranged siblings go back home and rebuild the family farm. Experienced solo or with up to 4 siblings (you don't actually have to be related; we won't check!). Work together to build up the farm, optimize it for peak efficiency, feed the town, and learn the secrets you chose to forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-